The four sub-programs that make up the Illinois Solar for All Program are:

1. The Low-Income Single-Family and Small Multi-Family Solar Incentive ( (also referred to as "** Residential Solar**" );
2. The Low-Income Community Solar Project Initiative ( (referred to as "**Community Solar**" );
3. The Non-Profit and Public Facilities program;
4. The Low-Income Multifamily Solar Incentive ( (referred to as "** Residential Solar**" ).
